---
source: crates/dev/tests/registry.rs
expression: "registry.run(&mut world, \"help\")?.text"
---
bind         Runs a command when a key is pressed.
exec         Runs a file's commands, a line at a time.
help         Shows the commands, or a command's or variable's help.
reset        Sets a variable back to its default.
set          Sets a variable.
spawn        Spawns objects of a tag in front of the player.
time         Sets the game's speed.
unbind       Takes a key's command away.
vars         Shows the variables whose names have the filter in them.
